
on object mode
s - scale object
g - grab
    x - direction x
    y - direction y
    z - direction z
a - select all
shift+a --> add mesh
numpad / --> isolate item

shift+c --> send the origin to the origin of the scene

shift + tab - enable/disable snaping 
shift + space --> show tool bar
x --> delete object
tag --> change between object and edit modes

shift MMB (midle mouse button)

on edit mode
    shift + space --> show tool bar
    1 - vertex selection
    2 - edges selection
    3 - face selection

    s - scale selection